---

---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-label">About</p>
      <h2>A bit about me</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="lead">
          I'm a designer who believes great design is invisible — it just
          works, and it makes you feel something.
        </p>
        <p>
          With a background spanning branding, UI/UX, and creative direction, I
          help brands and products find their voice through considered,
          purposeful design. Every project starts with understanding the
          problem, then crafting a solution that feels effortless.
        </p>
        <p>
          When I'm not designing, you can find me exploring new places,
          experimenting with photography, or diving into whatever's caught my
          curiosity lately.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-details">
        <div class="detail-group">
          <h4>Services</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Brand Identity</li>
            <li>UI/UX Design</li>
            <li>Web Design</li>
            <li>Creative Direction</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-group">
          <h4>Tools</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Figma</li>
            <li>Adobe Creative Suite</li>
            <li>Webflow</li>
            <li>Framer</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: var(--section-gap) 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem !important;
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
    line-height: 1.6 !important;
  }

  .detail-group {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h4 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      padding: 5rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
